Henrik is an [[Geography/Althane/Oresk/index|Oreskian]] of [[Geography/Althane/Oresk/Sarengrad|Sarengrad]], where most of his past lies, and a member of the [[Org/Althane/Golden Sparrows|Golden Sparrows]]. He breaks into [[Org/Althane/The First House|First House]] buildings to steal medicine and to keep Sparrow refuges from being found. He goes into a fight in full armor and behind a shield.

He travels with [[People/Althane/Lev|Lev]], [[People/Althane/Divex|Divex]] and [[People/Althane/Dawnmonger|Dawnmonger]] as [[Org/Althane/The Weft|the Weft]].
